# Vulnerability details

## Impact
A significant flaw exists in the presale logic of the Curves.sol contract, specifically in the handling of token purchases during the presale period. The current implementation does not effectively enforce the presale restrictions, allowing anyone to purchase tokens during the presale period, which undermines the purpose of having a whitelisted presale.

## Proof of Concept
Function Allowing Owner to Set Presale:
```
function buyCurvesTokenForPresale(
    address curvesTokenSubject,
    uint256 amount,
    uint256 startTime,
    bytes32 merkleRoot,
    uint256 maxBuy
) public payable onlyTokenSubject(curvesTokenSubject) {
    if (startTime <= block.timestamp) revert InvalidPresaleStartTime();
    uint256 supply = curvesTokenSupply[curvesTokenSubject];
