## Proof of Concept
Function `setCurves` is currently unprotected and anyone can overwrite `curves` for `FeeSpliter`:
```solidity
function setCurves(Curves curves_) public {
        curves = curves_;
    }
```

The variable `curves` is critically important to `FeeSplitter`; attacker who controls `curves` can control almost every aspect of `FeeSplitter`. For example, he can increase his own balance and claim all fees:
```solidity
