## Impact
Users may be aware of the selling price of their tokens and attempt to sell them when they believe the price is satisfactory. 
However, a malicious user can engage in front running, ultimately diminishing the selling price for that user.

## Proof of Concept
1. There is a subject token named `TOKEN`.
User `A` holds `100` tokens and User `B` holds `4` tokens. 
The total supply is `200`. 
User `B` evaluates the selling price by invoking the `getSellPriceAfterFee` function.
```
