# Vulnerability details

## Impact
Claimable fee amount is calculated by `owed = (data.cumulativeFeePerToken - data.userFeeOffset[account]) * balance` with `balance` is the current curve token balance of the `account`.

An attacker could drain fees from the contract by transferring curve token to another address and then claim fees by that address

