## Impact
Due to the nature of how `FeeSplitter::claimFees()`, `FeeSplitter::getClaimableFees()`, as well as the `deposit()` and `withdraw()` functions work in Curves.sol a malicious user can sandwich a stepwise jump in the rewards accrual in FeeSplitter.sol, stealing the majority of rewards without having to be part of the ecosystem.

