A stepwise jump OR a large accrual of funds in the FeeSplitter can happen due to multiple reasons in a certain curvesTokenSubject.

- The holder fee was increased and the token gained popularity.
- There is a very large buy transaction that happened / is happening which will increase the accrued rewards due to the holder's fee in the FeeSplitter.sol
- Sudden gain in popularity of the token if a famous person bought it / is owning it. 

A malicious user doesn't have to own the tokens or have them in the system, using a flash loan they can enter the system, claim rewards and exit again in the same transaction - stealing the majority of the accrued rewards. 

