The Boolean variable `referralDefined` is assigned to check if the creator has a referral address, hence sending rewards to the referrer. However, the implemented logic is the opposite.

If `referralDefined` is true (meaning there is a referral), then `buyValue` is assigned the value of `protocolFee`.

If `referralDefined` is false (meaning there is no referral), then `buyValue` is assigned the value of `protocolFee + referralFee`.
