## Impact

Referral fee is intended to be a fee that a user gain by referring another user.

However a user has the capability to set their own account as the referral fee recipient even if it has been referred by someone else.

He can also decide to change at any time the referral fee recipient and set it to a malicious contract.

This could lead to two different impacts:

1. the user earns a fee that he is not entitled to
2. a malicious user can decide to make a DoS attack to its own tokens and freeze all holders to sell his token

