        data.userFeeOffset[account] = data.cumulativeFeePerToken;
    }
}
```

The `onBalanceChange()` function in the FeeSplitter.sol file updates the user's `data.userFeeOffset[account]` to the latest `data.cumulativeFeePerToken`. This function is activated with every buy or sell transaction in the Curves contract.

