## Proof of Concept
Protocol implements a feature that allows users to transfer freely their tokens from the Curves protocol to the ERC20 format and back to Curves protocol. (let's call it internal token and exported token from now on).

The internal token version can be freely [transferred](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-01-curves/blob/516aedb7b9a8d341d0d2666c23780d2bd8a9a600/contracts/Curves.sol#L295-L299) to other addresses. 

