# Vulnerability details

## Impact

There are two ways for the new address to receive tokens: `mint` and `transfer`.
The `userFeeOffset` is reset through `onBalanceChange` during `mint`, but `onBalanceChange` is not called during `transfer`.
An attacker can perform multiple transfers to claim rewards and steal all of FeeSplitter’s reward funds.

